title: The <span style="color: #7A3C00;">**SS**</span> (<span style="color: #7A3C00;">*Schutzstaffel*</span>) asserts its independence from the <span style="color: #7A3C00;">**SA**</span> (<span style="color: #7A3C00;">*Sturmabteilung*</span>)!
subtitle: A new instrument of terror is taking shape.
