= The <span style="color: #7A3C00;">**SS**</span> becomes increasingly independent

Following the “Röhm Putsch” — also known as the “Night of the Long Knives” — the <span style="color: #7A3C00;">**SS**</span> participated in the purge of the <span style="color: #7A3C00;">**SA**</span> leadership and emerged as an increasingly independent organization within the <span style="color: #7A3C00;">**Nazi**</span> regime.

Under <span style="color: #7A3C00;">*Heinrich Himmler*</span>, the black-uniformed organization is rapidly transforming into one of the regime’s most dangerous instruments of terror.